OL,3,GNEWSAModel flying club grounded as it
OL,4,Alooks for new site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairman of a model aircraft flying
OL,7,Fclub said he felt "disappointed" it
OL,8,Ffaced eviction from its current home.
OL,10,FNeil Chapman said Doddington Model
OL,11,FClub, which flies from a field owned by
OL,12,FRSPCA Block Fen in Cambridgeshire, was
OL,13,Fdesperately searching for a new base,
OL,14,Fhaving been told it would need to leave
OL,15,Fby 24 October.
OL,17,F"It is disappointing that it has come
OL,18,Fvery suddenly. We haven't got long to
OL,19,Ffind a new location," he said.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
