OL,3,GNEWSAModel flying club grounded as it
OL,4,Alooks for new site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA said it had provided the
OL,7,Fclub, which has 25 members, with
OL,8,F"notice to facilitate their
OL,9,Ftransition", adding "we sincerely wish
OL,10,Fthem every success in finding a new
OL,11,Flocation".
